tasks.technicalInstructions:
1. Option A (CMS Level): Navigate to Rank Math > Titles & Meta > Post Archives / Categories. Update Archive Title format to: `%title% %sep% Page %page% %sep% %sitename%`.
2. Option B (Theme Level for Florin): In `bpa-ohdeer-hq/functions.php`, add:
```php
add_filter('rank_math/frontend/title', function($title) {
    if (is_paged()) { $page = get_query_var('paged'); return $title . ' - Page ' . $page; }
    return $title;
});
```
3. Purge WP Engine object cache and Cloudflare edge cache.
